{"title":"Rimeworm Elder","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 63 Rimeworm that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">stab</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/rimeworm-elder\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/rimeworm-elder?lv=63\">Lv 63 <span>9</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/rimeworm-elder?lv=64\">Lv 64 <span>2</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/rimeworm-elder?lv=63\" title=\"Pick level 63\"><td><b>63</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>476</td><td>39.2</td><td>3,150</td><td class=\"muted\">1,428 · 54.9 · 9,450</td><td>9</td><td>in the wilds around 33, -1154</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/rimeworm-elder?lv=64\" title=\"Pick level 64\"><td><b>64</b></td><td>483</td><td>39.7</td><td>3,200</td><td class=\"muted\">1,449 · 55.6 · 9,600</td><td>2</td><td>in the wilds around 29, -1153</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 1 looted corpse recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 1 recorded drop, 246 total, 246 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×246</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"titanium-scimitar\" title=\"Titanium Scimitar - in 1 of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/22b880f27953d48cbeb1.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Titanium Scimitar</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-815.1px,385.2px)\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/2/-2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:512px;top:-512px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/3/-2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:768px;top:-512px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/4/-2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1024px;top:-512px\"><i style=\"left:812.6px;top:-386.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:827.8px;top:-381.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:714.3px;top:-433.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:853.9px;top:-392.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:794.1px;top:-381.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:787.2px;top:-384.3px\"></i></div></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around 32, -1154 <span class=\"muted\">· 5 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around -127, -1156 <span class=\"muted\">· 4 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"rimeworm-elder\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>Named ones <span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:14px\">(1)</span></h2><div class=\"named-grid\"><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/hollowtooth\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/0047941c3282c0f339ca.svg\" alt=\"\"><b>Hollowtooth</b><span>Lv 64</span></a></div>\n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Rimeworm: <a href=\"#/monster/rimeworm-hatchling\">Rimeworm Hatchling</a> <span class=\"muted\">(60)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/rimeworm\">Rimeworm</a> <span class=\"muted\">(62)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/rimeworm-queen\">Rimeworm Queen</a> <span class=\"muted\">(64)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/dda05deae66056251fa0.svg\" alt=\"Rimeworm Elder\"></div><h3>Rimeworm Elder</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>63 <span class=\"muted\">(seen 63–64)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Rimeworm</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>crush · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>476</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>39.2</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>3150</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>4.0 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>2.39</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>10 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}